<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>High Cadence Intervals</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-13min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 4min @ 87% FTP (Z4, RPE 5-6)
- 1min @ 70% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
- 4min @ 87% FTP (Z4, RPE 5-6)
- 4x4min @ 85% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6), 3min recovery @ 55% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
-Cadence: 100-120rpm blocks; 100-110rpm recoveries
-Position: Seated, drops for higher cadence efforts

COOL-DOWN:
-9min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 3/6: Development - Standard training load, building consistency
-Hold 100-120rpm through each work block; spin 100-110rpm on recovery.

EXECUTION:
-Hold every cadence target through the work block and recovery. Keep the hips quiet and let power stay where it is prescribed.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="780" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.87" CadenceLow="100" CadenceHigh="120" />
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="0.70" CadenceLow="100" CadenceHigh="120" />
    <SteadyState Duration="240" Power="0.87" CadenceLow="100" CadenceHigh="120" />
    <IntervalsT Repeat="4" OnDuration="240" OnPower="0.85" CadenceLow="105" CadenceHigh="115" OffDuration="180" OffPower="0.55" />
    <Cooldown Duration="540" PowerLow="0.70" PowerHigh="0.50" />
  </workout>
</workout_file>